# ─── Pipeline output artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# architecture/ holds the output artifacts (architecture.json, spec cards,
# raw-tree.json, progress.json, custom-id-map.json). It is gitignored: each run
# regenerates these files locally, and curated past analyses are kept in a
# separate private repo (archmapper-analyses) rather than this codebase.
architecture/

